  "notes": [
    "Solder the tab to a large ground copper area: it is the heat path (the datasheet's thermal figures assume 0.5 to 3 in² of copper).",
    "Keep the loop CIN, VIN, OUTPUT, D1 and GND short and wide; route FEEDBACK away from the inductor and the OUTPUT node, taking it from the output capacitor.",
